  "title": "Ziyarat of Safiyyah and Atikah, Aunts of the Holy Prophet (s.a.w.a.)",
  "data": "At the graves of the Prophet's aunts in al-Baqi, beside Lady Umm al-Baneen's, recite:\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكُمَا يَا عَمَّتَيْ رَسُوْلِ اللّٰهِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKUMAA YAA A'MMATAY RASOOLILLAAH\nPeace be upon you both, O aunts of the Messenger of Allah.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكُمَا يَا عَمَّتَيْ نَبِيِّ اللّٰهِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKUMAA YAA A'MMATAY NABIYYILLAAH\nPeace be upon you both, O aunts of the Prophet of Allah.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكُمَا يَا عَمَّتَيْ حَبِيْبِ اللّٰهِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKUMAA YAA A'MMATAY HABEEBILLAAH\nPeace be upon you both, O aunts of the beloved of Allah.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكُمَا يَا عَمَّتَيِ الْمُصْطَفٰى\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKUMAA YAA A'MMATAYIL MUSTAFAA\nPeace be upon you both, O aunts of the Chosen One.\nرَضِيَ اللّٰهُ تَعَالٰى عَنْكُمَا وَجَعَلَ الْجَنَّةَ مَنْزِلَكُمَا\nRADIYALLAAHU TA'AALAA A'NKUMAA WA JA'ALAL JANNATA MANZILAKUMAA\nMay Allah, the Exalted, be pleased with you both and make Paradise your dwelling,\nوَرَحْمَةُ اللّٰهِ وَبَرَكَاتُهٗ\nWA RAHMATULLAAHI WA BARAKAATUH\nand the mercy of Allah and His blessings be upon you.",
  "merits": "Safiyyah and Atikah were daughters of Abd al-Muttalib, sisters of the Prophet's (s.a.w.a.) father Abdullah. Safiyyah, the sister of Hamzah (a.s.), accepted Islam early, emigrated to Madinah and was at Uhud and the Trench; she was a poet, mourned the Prophet in verse, and died in 20 AH. Whether Atikah accepted Islam and emigrated is disputed. Their graves are near that of Lady Umm al-Baneen (s.a.) ([Ziyarat of Lady Umm al-Baneen (s.a.)](G81)).\n\nThis ziyarat is given in the Shia manuals of Hajj, such as Sayyid Jawad Husayni Shahrudi's Adab al-Haramayn, without a narrated source."
}
